&lt;li&gt;Well-being benefits include access to ClassPass, OneMedical, UrbanSitter, and Spring Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work environment: our employees local to NYC are expected to work Tuesdays through Thursdays from our HQ in Union Square, Manhattan. Tasty lunches catered from a variety of local restaurants and frequent employee-organized cultural events contribute to our positive office energy. On Monday/Friday most employees Zoom into work from home while some take advantage of the quieter office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
