&lt;p&gt;Alloy is the AI-powered identity and fraud prevention platform that accelerates onboarding, stops fraud, and scales compliance across the customer lifecycle so financial organizations can grow without limits. More than 900 of the world&#39;s leading financial institutions and fintechs trust Alloy for smarter risk management that drives growth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Through our values: Be Bold, Go Fast, Collaborate, and Celebrate Our Differences, we are creating a workplace where you can grow, thrive, and belong. See how we’ve been continuously recognized and named one of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inc.com/profile/alloy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Inc.Magazine’s Best Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/companies/alloy/?list=americas-best-startup-employers&amp;amp;sh=55c076453c61&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Forbes America’s Best Startup Employers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.americanbanker.com/list/best-places-to-work-in-fintech-2022&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Best Fintech to Work for by American Banker&lt;/a&gt;, year after year.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Check out our investors and read more about us &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alloy.com/about&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alloy is looking for an Applied AI Engineer to sit within our centralized Ops team and drive meaningful AI transformation across the entire business. This is a high-impact, cross-functional role for someone who loves finding inefficiencies, designing elegant solutions, and enabling people to work smarter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the connective tissue between cutting-edge AI capabilities and the practical, day-to-day needs of our teams — identifying where automation and AI can reduce toil, accelerate workflows, and unlock capacity for higher-value work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alloy operates in a hybrid-work environment. We look to foster collaboration and community by having our local employees onsite three days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-impact automation and AI opportunities across the business, prioritized against strategic goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and deploy AI-powered solutions — from lightweight automations to more sophisticated LLM-based workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with teams across Alloy to understand their pain points and translate them into scalable technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and enable AI adoption across the organization — running enablement sessions, building internal tooling, and helping teams become more self-sufficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish best practices, tooling standards, and frameworks for how Alloy builds and evaluates AI solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate the internal stack like a product, running experiments, creating feedback loops, and continuously improving productivity across the whole organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact of what you ship and continuously iterate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building with LLMs and AI APIs (e.g. OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.) in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering fundamentals — comfortable writing clean, maintainable code in Python or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow automation tools (e.g. Zapier, Make, n8n, or custom-built pipelines)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A business-minded approach: you think about ROI and impact, not just technical elegance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills — you can explain complex AI concepts to non-technical stakeholders and bring people along on the journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and a bias toward shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in an ops, revenue operations, or business systems role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data tooling (SQL, dbt, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a fast-growing startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have a rare combination of autonomy and breadth — working across every team at Alloy, with a direct line to business impact. This isn&#39;t a role where you&#39;ll be handed a backlog. You&#39;ll define the roadmap, build the solutions, and see the results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a lean team, so your impact will be felt immediately, and opportunities will grow as the company scales up. If this all sounds like a good fit for you, why not join us?&lt;/p&gt;
