&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO and flexible work policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, vision plans with HSA (monthly employer contribution) and FSA options&lt;/li&gt;
