&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve the architecture across CRM, Sales Engagement, and related GTM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Workflow Efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
