&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Client Success Manager, you’ll be part of a high-impact team responsible for driving value and trust with some of the most sophisticated financial institutions and fintechs in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The CSM team owns the client relationship end-to-end, balancing account strategy, commercial goals, and hands-on product guidance while collaborating across Sales, Product, Engineering, and Technical Success.&lt;/p&gt;
