&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Client Success Manager on the Enterprise team, you will be a strategic partner to Alloy’s largest and highest priority accounts. You will own and deepen relationships with our clients to ensure they are realizing tangible value from using Alloy, driving adoption and optimization while finding opportunities to expand our commercial footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
