&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Through our values: Be Bold, Go Fast, Collaborate, and Celebrate Our Differences, we are creating a workplace where you can grow, thrive, and belong. See how we’ve been continuously recognized and named one of &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.inc.com/profile/alloy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.inc.com/profile/alloy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Inc. Magazine’s Best Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/companies/alloy/?list=americas-best-startup-employers&amp;amp;sh=55c076453c61&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/companies/alloy/?list=americas-best-startup-employers&amp;amp;sh=55c076453c61&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes America’s Best Startup Employers&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.americanbanker.com/list/best-places-to-work-in-fintech&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.americanbanker.com/list/best-places-to-work-in-fintech&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Best Fintech to Work for by American Banker&lt;/a&gt;, year after year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
